{"Title":"An Act relative to termination of sales to wholesalers by suppliers of alcoholic beverages","BillNumber":"H371","DocketNumber":"HD3633","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MJM1","Name":"Michael J. Moran","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T14:36:17.813"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MJM1","Name":"Michael J. Moran","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T14:36:17.8133333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H371/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Moran of Boston, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 371) of Michael J. Moran relative to the termination of sales to wholesalers by suppliers of alcoholic beverages.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 25E of chapter 138 of the Massachusetts General Laws as appearing in the 2012 Official Edition is hereby amended by adding the following subsection:-\r\n\tSection 25E(1). Any distiller, manufacturer, importer or producer which obtains or acquires in any manner the right to sell, ship or distribute any brand item shall for the purpose of this section stand in the place of, and be subject to, all the rights, privileges, and duties and obligations of its predecessor from whom such brands or brand items were obtained or acquired.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}